# History: up arrow recalls the last prompt; ctrl+r searches.
name: history
size: 100x30
args: --permission-mode default
files: ../../../testdata/fixtures/12/app
script: scripts/history.json
parity: HI-01, HI-06
---
ready
type alpha prompt
keys enter
wait_for 30s First answer.
type beta prompt
keys enter
wait_for 30s Second answer.
settle
keys up
settle
checkpoint recalled
keys esc esc
settle
keys ctrl+r
type alp
settle
checkpoint search
